algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: Rank function ρ : N × N → N, bound N
Output: Barcode B

B ← ∅
for a = 0 to N:
    for b = a to N:
        μ ← ρ(a,b) - ρ(a,b+1)
        if a > 0: μ ← μ - ρ(a-1,b) + ρ(a-1,b+1)
        if μ = 1: B ← B ∪ {(a, b)}
        if μ ∉ {0, 1}: REJECT
return B

Time: O(N²)  Space: O(N²)

Input: Barcode B = {I₁, ..., I_k}
Output: Filtered graph G

V ← {v₁, ..., v_{2k}}
E ← ∅
for j = 1 to k:
    E ← E ∪ {(v_{2j-1}, v_{2j}, birth(Iⱼ), death(Iⱼ))}
return G = (V, E)

Time: O(k)  Space: O(k)
